{
  "item": "DarkHorse",
  "mu_name": "Dark Horse",
  "mu_name_from": "AccessModel(MODEL_DARK_HORSE, L\"Data\\\\Skill\\\\\", L\"DarkHorse\") (ZzzOpenData.cpp:4206), so Data/Skill/DarkHorse.bmd, its sheets from Skill\\ (OpenTexture, :4363): the thirteen dk* of its thirteen meshes. The ridden figure only; the bag item is DarkHorseHorn.bmd. GOBoid.cpp creates it for a player whose helper is ITEM_DARK_HORSE_ITEM, 13/4 (NewUIMyInventory.cpp:1007-1008, WSclient.cpp:2453).",
  "profile": "monster",
  "profile_note": "A creature on its own rig under the rider, as Uniria's horse and the Dinorant.",
  "rig_from": "60 bones and seven actions (export-rig --actions=all). GOBoid.cpp:323-428 plays 0 while its rider stands (Velocity 0.3), 1 under PLAYER_RUN_RIDE_HORSE (0.34), 2 under the ride strikes PLAYER_ATTACK_RIDE_STRIKE to _ATTACK_MAGIC (0.34), 3 under PLAYER_ATTACK_DARKHORSE, Earthshake (0.34), 5 and 6 under the two horse idles (1.0); 4 is never asked for. 0 and 1 are 7 keys, 2 six (locked), 3 ten, 4-6 41, 51 and 31.",
  "play_speed": 0.34,
  "play_speed_note": "One rate for the model, the run's and the swings': its stand at MU's 0.3 and its run are drawn on its rider's clock as a fraction (game/pets.cpp), so only a swing plays at this rate.",
  "scale_from": "1.0 at CreateMount (GOBoid.cpp:107-109) and 1.0 drawn (RenderMount, :684-691). No bone link: it copies the rider's position and angles (:333-336); BoneHead 7 (:330).",
  "sheets": {
    "dkfurop": "dkfurop.png",
    "dkfrontleg": "dkfrontleg.png",
    "dkhead2": "dkhead2.png",
    "dkhip": "dkhip.png",
