    "dkneck2": "dkneck2.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Skill/dk*.OZJ, and dkfurop.OZT (32x32, the violet-black mane, its alpha cutting away 56%), from MuMain's own bin/Data. dkhorsebase (128x128) is the black hide; the other eleven (32x32 and 64x64) are the barding: dark blue enamel plates edged in gold, the green-jewelled hip plates and the saddle.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "dkfurop": "hair",
    "dkfrontleg": "painted_steel",
    "dkhead2": "painted_steel",
    "dkhip": "painted_steel",
    "dksaddle": "painted_steel",
    "dkbackleg": "painted_steel",
    "dkneck": "painted_steel",
    "dkfrontShd": "painted_steel",
    "dkhorsebase": "fur",
    "dkfrontleg2": "painted_steel",
    "dkbackleg2": "painted_steel",
    "dkheadwing": "painted_steel",
    "dkneck2": "painted_steel"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Judged from the sheets: the hide is fur, the mane hair, the barding enamelled plate with gold trim.",
  "cutout": [
    "dkfurop"
  ],
  "cutout_from": "dkfurop.OZT's alpha, too soft to be its own mask (4% of it solid): keyed, as the mane's cards.",
  "chrome": [
    {
