      ]
    }
  ],
  "chrome_from": "RenderObject's MODEL_DARK_HORSE arm (ZzzObject.cpp:783-790): the body RENDER_TEXTURE under BodyLight 1, then meshes 12-15 RENDER_CHROME | RENDER_BRIGHT under BodyLight (1, 0.8, 0.3). The model has thirteen, so the pass is mesh 12 alone, dkneck2, the plate over the neck. Its eighth argument is o->HiddenMesh, -1, so no chrome image is bound: the mesh's own sheet at RENDER_CHROME's coordinates, added in gold (`own`). At 0.4 where MU draws 1: MU's stacked passes overshoot under our bloom (the Flamberge's lesson). pipeline/chrome_sheets.py.",
  "effects_note": "Carried in the drawing (game/pets.cpp, Play): the dust off its hooves while it runs, rand_fps_check(2) at the horse +-32, white in Devias (GOBoid.cpp:381-396, fx/dust.h); its breath, rand_fps_check(3) a BITMAP_SMOKE at (50, -4, 0) in bone 27's frame, Bone03, the head (:432-447, fx/snort.h), a bubble in Atlans; pHorseStep1-3 under its run (ZzzCharacter.cpp:764-767, mount_hoof). Gone at alpha 0 on a safe tile (:324-329), faded here. Not carried: its Earthshake (clip 3's blur and RenderDarkHorseSkill, :449-461) comes with the skill; Icarus's and the Maya scene's shock waves under its hooves (:346-379) are for a map it cannot enter here (sim::canFly); the shadow it casts by RenderBodyShadow (ZzzObject.cpp:792-809) is the engine's own.",
  "stats_note": "No item row: the ridden figure. The row is DarkHorseHorn's (13/4).",
